     [38;5;246mOne logger module, levels, structured records, console output. Pluggable sink so remote shipping is an additive [39m
     [38;5;246mchange later. No dependencies, no backend.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Ship to our own collector
     [38;5;246mClient batches records and POSTs them to an endpoint we build. Real production visibility, but needs a backend, [39m
     [38;5;246mretry/backoff, and strict redaction.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Third-party SDK (Sentry etc.)
